<title>SOUTH KOREA: Taehwa to apply for court receivership.</title>
<headline>Taehwa to apply for court receivership.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Taehwa Shopping Co Ltd will file an application on Monday with a Seoul court to protect the company from its creditors, a company official said.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have had some problems running the company,&quot; the official said. &quot;So the board of directors decided to file for court receivership this morning.&quot;</p>
<p>He said the company had not defaulted on any debts but declined to give further details.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
